abstract: >-
  Web platform for daily wildfire-danger mapping in Galicia, Spain. It dispatches
  requests to the STORCITO wildfire calculation engine and delivers continuous
  and classified danger surfaces, input-coverage rasters and factor layers
  through GeoServer to a React/Cesium map viewer. Developed within the STORCITO
  project, funded by the European Union's Horizon Europe programme under grant
  agreement No. 101182153.
keywords:
  - wildfire danger
  - Galicia
  - Fire Weather Index
  - Analytic Hierarchy Process
  - Earth observation
  - web mapping
